        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have a strong connection to fey who favor combat, and you have an innate knack for using weapons. You have familiarity with longbows, composite longbows, rapiers, shortbows, composite shortbows, and shortswords—for the purposes of proficiency, you treat any of these that are martial weapons as simple weapons. Instead of casting @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Light], you can cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shield] as a primal innate spell at will.</p>"
